package(USEPKG LokiAmBe LOKI)

######################################################################

The setups of the LoKI detector test with an AmBe source (October 2026) as
simulation parameters (data/setups.toml, python/Setups.py):

  sb_detectortest2026october_params                  (the setups)
  sb_detectortest2026october_params C                (the parameters of setup C)
  sb_detectortest2026october_sim setup=C [...]       (sb_lokiambe_sim with them)
  sb_detectortest2026october_simanachain <dir> setup=C [...]

Further parameters on the command line replace those of the setup.

Primary author: milan.klausz@ess.eu
